<title>MEXICO: Maseca nine months net rises. [CORRECTED 23:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Maseca nine months net rises. [CORRECTED 23:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects period in headline to nine months from six months)</p>
<p>			    1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Revs		4.567 bln		2.981 bln</p>
<p>	Oper income     660.48 million	     474.47 million</p>
<p>	Net		 445.43 million	     362.88 million</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Full company name is Grupo Industrial Maseca S.A.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289500</p>
</text>
